1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Listen to an announcement at a university event.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:09,802
The annual student art exhibition opens this Thursday at 3 PM in the University Gallery,

3
00:00:09,802 --> 00:00:14,150
featuring paintings and sculptures by our incredibly talented art students.

4
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:18,180
It's opening a month earlier this year to accommodate the gallery renovation.

5
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:22,505
New this year, you'll have the chance to talk with the artists,

6
00:00:22,505 --> 00:00:27,190
hear the stories behind their work, and gain insight into their creative journeys.

7
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:33,080
Artists will be on site Fridays from 4 to 5 PM this week and next.
